o_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FEMPUNKS_poster _bands_2560x1440.png", "id": "1108139076976734", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982692_1108139080310067_5763536815497042764_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RsBKvtzgTf4Q7kNvwFWOEVR&_nc_oc=Adrd-OiWLVyEEJ80apNN8d6klde6s9NdFb6ANodOk5NitenwxH3xcn-8wYDQwgzWDWg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSf3IRj8ijSEIOkdLMk3uV8BEoLJ4PjOEd5Jeoi0-sXTg&oe=6B09C98D"}, "display_name": "Fempunks", "keywords": ["punk", "beat", "rock", "music", "rhythm"], "long_description": "Female fronted punk and rock bands from around the world. Three ways to play - two Beat modes and an Arcade (simplified) Drums mode. \nIncludes:\nNova Twins   \"Choose your fighter\"   (UK)\nNobro        \"Let's Do Drugs\"   (Canada)\nTeen Jesus and the Jeans Teasers   \"Girl Sports\"   (Australia)\nNoukie \"I'm f*cked\"  (Sweden)\nSincere Engineer  \"Trust Me\"  (America)\nIlluminati Hotties  \"Pool Hopping\" (America)\nPinkshift   \"Nothing\"   (America)\nHot Wax \"High Tea\" (UK)\nVial \"Just fine\"  (America)\nPale Lips \"Old Flame\"  (Canada)\nMargarita Podridas  \"Tornillo   (Mexico)\nTaxi Girls \"Sunshine\" (Canada)\nTiger Bell \"I don't want to hear about your band\" (Sweden)\nThe Sorels \"She's in the gang\"  (Canada)\nThick \"Love you forever\" (USA)\n \n\n", "short_description": "NOW WITH NO FAIL MODE! ENJOY THE MUSIC EVEN IF YOU'RE NOT A GREAT PLAYER (Use regular mode to get on the Leaderboard though!)\n\nDodge bottles, smash drums and rock out to great female and non-binary driven punk music from around the world. Get to know the bands by playing along with their music videos. Three gameplay modes including The Club, The Moshpit and Space Drums."}]}, "developer_name": "20 Below Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.20below.ca/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Playbook Games", "support_website_url": nu